    "text": "<p>A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;inches long pencil <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> with mid point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> and a small eraser <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> are placed on the horizontal top of a table such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math> inches and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. The acute angle through which the pencil must be rotated about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> so that the perpendicular distance between eraser and pencil becomes exactly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> inch is :</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0032_a01607164669.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 185px;\" /></p>"
